------------------------------------------------------------------------------
ETHICAL USE NOTICE
------------------------------------------------------------------------------
These Materials are documentation, analysis, and defensive guidance for
educational and authorized security-research purposes only. They intentionally
contain no deployable attack tooling and no captured data.

Conducting rogue access point ("evil twin") or captive-portal credential-capture
attacks against networks or people without explicit written authorization is
illegal in most jurisdictions (including, in Indonesia, under UU ITE and UU PDP;
and elsewhere under laws such as the US Computer Fraud and Abuse Act and the UK
Computer Misuse Act).

The author provides these Materials to help practitioners understand and DEFEND
against such attacks. Any offensive use must occur only within a controlled lab
you own, or under a signed engagement scope with the owner's written permission.
You are solely responsible for complying with all applicable laws.
